# College Notice Board App 📢

A modern Android application for college notice management, built for MAD PBL Project.

### ✨ Features
- View all college notices in real-time
- Admin can Add / Delete notices
- Clean and modern Material Design UI
- Firebase Integration (if used) / Local Storage
- Category wise notices

### 🛠️ Tech Stack
- Language: Kotlin 100%
- IDE: Android Studio
- UI: XML with Material Design
- Version Control: Git & GitHub

